      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start, but i just ran it through our internal checker and the simplicity score came back a bit lower than we'd like for this specific patient demographic. it's technically fine, but we might get flagged for being too \"dense\" in some parts.\n\ncan you try a version that's a bit more streamlined to help bump that syllable-count score up? i still need the medical accuracy to stay intact and it needs to sound professional, but maybe try to use more direct, punchy language so it's even easier for the patients to scan. just try to get that score higher without it turning into a children's book, if that makes sense.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
