      "content": "Hypertension is really when the blood flowing through your arteries has too great a push. This high blood pressure puts extra strain on your whole system, even if you feel fine most of the time. It is a major health issue that needs your close attention and care.\n\nSince this condition can damage your heart and kidneys slowly, taking action now is vital for your long-term health. Simple changes and proper medical care work together to keep your blood pressure in a safe range. This guide is here to give you clear steps on how you can manage your health effectively.",
      "source": "target",
